{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xuhuwang-e-dcbae80e640b636c89fb","title":"嘉平六年诏褒徐邈胡质田豫赐家钱谷","accounts":[{"id":"xuhuwang-a-dcbae80e640b636c89fb","label":"正文","text":"嘉平六年诏褒徐邈胡质田豫赐家钱谷","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-24421d34edb4fe759449"]},{"id":"xuhuwang-a-152a92c0abf569c8e79c","label":"正文","text":"嘉平六年诏褒胡质赐其家钱谷","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-e2d8f00cb07b85545121"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xuhuwang-q-24421d34edb4fe759449","xuhuwang-q-e2d8f00cb07b85545121"]},"ordering_evidence":"xuhuwang-q-24421d34edb4fe759449","order":5300}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"xuhuwang-q-24421d34edb4fe759449","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-8863dbc204a30a4b64cc","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖1〗，朝廷追思清节之士，诏曰：“夫显贤表德，圣王所重；举善而教〖2〗，仲尼所美。故司空徐邈、征东将军胡质、卫尉田豫，皆服职前朝〖3〗，历事四世〖4〗；出统戎马，入赞庶政；忠清在公，忧国忘私，不营产业；身没之后，家无余财。朕甚嘉之。其赐邈等家谷二千斛，钱三十万。布告天下。”","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":139},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-e2d8f00cb07b85545121","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-ecfa6f8049734d568ff5","layer":"original","quote":"六年〖12〗，诏书褒述质清行〖13〗，赐其家钱谷。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":89,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
